  "text": "### 7. Committee Self-Assessment  \n**Annual Assessment:**\n- Committee effectiveness review\n- Member skills and experience assessment\n- Meetings and processes evaluation\n- Recommendations for improvements  \n**Areas Assessed:**\n- Committee composition (skills, independence, diversity)\n- Meeting effectiveness (time use, agenda relevance)\n- Quality of information/papers provided\n- Engagement with management\n- Stakeholder communication  \n**Actions:**\n- Results reported to Board\n- Training identified and provided\n- Process improvements implemented",
